- NCMatrix -- Negates NCMatrices
********************************

  * Operator: *note -: (Macaulay2Doc)-,
  * Usage: 
        L = -M
  * Inputs:
      * M, an instance of the type *note NCMatrix: NCMatrix,, 
  * Outputs:
      * L, an instance of the type *note NCMatrix: NCMatrix,, 

Description
===========

This negates NCMatrices.

+--------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : A = QQ{x,y,z}                                |
|                                                  |
|o1 = A                                            |
|                                                  |
|o1 : NCPolynomialRing                             |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : M = ncMatrix {{x, y, z}}                     |
|                                                  |
|o2 = | x y z |                                    |
|                                                  |
|o2 : NCMatrix                                     |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : sigma = ncMap(A,A,{y,z,x})                   |
|                                                  |
|o3 = NCRingMap A <--- A                           |
|                                                  |
|o3 : NCRingMap                                    |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : N = ncMatrix {{M},{sigma M}, {sigma sigma M}}|
|                                                  |
|o4 = | x y z |                                    |
|     | y z x |                                    |
|     | z x y |                                    |
|                                                  |
|o4 : NCMatrix                                     |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : -N                                           |
|                                                  |
|o5 = | -x -y -z |                                 |
|     | -y -z -x |                                 |
|     | -z -x -y |                                 |
|                                                  |
|o5 : NCMatrix                                     |
+--------------------------------------------------+

