ambient(NCRingMap) -- Extends an NCRingMap to the ambient ring of the source.
*****************************************************************************

  * Function: *note ambient: (Macaulay2Doc)ambient,
  * Usage: 
        g = ambient f
  * Inputs:
      * f, an instance of the type *note NCRingMap: NCRingMap,, 
  * Outputs:
      * g, an instance of the type *note NCRingMap: NCRingMap,, 

Description
===========

If f:R->S is a ring map and R=A/I is a quotient ring, this method returns the
NCRingMap g:A->S obtained by composing f with the natural map. This method is
called by *note isWellDefined(NCRingMap): isWellDefined_lpNCRingMap_rp, and can
be used to determine what ideal to mod out of the target so the map becomes
well-defined.

+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : A = skewPolynomialRing(QQ,(-1)_QQ,{w,x,y,z})    |
|--Calling Bergman for NCGB calculation.              |
|Complete!                                            |
|                                                     |
|o1 = A                                               |
|                                                     |
|o1 : NCQuotientRing                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : B = QQ{w,x,y,z}/ncIdeal{w*x+x*w,w*y+y*w,x*y+y*x}|
|--Calling Bergman for NCGB calculation.              |
|Complete!                                            |
|                                                     |
|o2 = B                                               |
|                                                     |
|o2 : NCQuotientRing                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : f = ncMap(B,A,gens B)                           |
|                                                     |
|o3 = NCRingMap B <--- A                              |
|                                                     |
|o3 : NCRingMap                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : isWellDefined f                                 |
|                                                     |
|o4 = false                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : g = ambient f                                   |
|                                                     |
|o5 = NCRingMap B <--- QQ{w, x, y, z}                 |
|                                                     |
|o5 : NCRingMap                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : (gens ideal A)/g                                |
|                                                     |
|o6 = {0, 0, 0, zw+wz, zx+xz, zy+yz}                  |
|                                                     |
|o6 : List                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------+

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note ambient(NCRingMap): ambient_lpNCRingMap_rp, -- Extends an NCRingMap
    to the ambient ring of the source.
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

