assignDegrees -- Weights entries of a matrix to make associated map of free modules graded
******************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        assignDegrees(M) or assignDegrees(M,targetDegs,sourceDegs)
  * Inputs:
      * M, an instance of the type *note NCMatrix: NCMatrix,, 
      * targetDegs, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, a list of integer
        weights for the target basis vectors
      * sourceDegs, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, a list of integer
        weights for the source basis vectors
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note NCMatrix: NCMatrix,, the same matrix M
        with source and target keys specified and isHomogeneous flag true

Description
===========

A matrix M with homogeneous entries in an NCRing can determine a homomorphism
of graded free modules if the entries satisfy certain consistency conditions.
Finding a set of degrees for source and target basis vectors such that M
determines a graded module map is an integer programming problem. This method
does not solve the problem in general.



With only one input, this method checks to see if the entries in each column
all have the same homogeneous degree. If so, the method assigns source and
target degrees in the natural way and the *note isHomogeneous:
(Macaulay2Doc)isHomogeneous, flag is set for M. If not, all degrees are set to
0 and the flag is not set. This method is called any time a matrix is created.



With three inputs, the user may specify the desired degree shifts on inputs and
outputs such that the associated module map is graded.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : B = threeDimSklyanin(QQ,{1,1,-1},{x,y,z})                               |
|--Calling Bergman for NCGB calculation.                                      |
|Complete!                                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = B                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : NCQuotientRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : M = ncMatrix {{x,y,z,0}, {-y*z-2*x^2,-y*x,z*x-x*z,x},{x*y-2*y*x,x*z,-x^2|
|                                                                             |
|o2 = | x          y    z         0 |                                         |
|     | -y*z-2*x^2 -y*x y^2-2*x*z x |                                         |
|     | -2*y*x+x*y x*z  -x^2      y |                                         |
|     | -2*y^2+x*z x^2  -x*y      z |                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : NCMatrix                                                                |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|,y}, {-y^2-z*x,x^2,-x*y,z}}                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : isHomogeneous M                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = false                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : assignDegrees(M,{1,0,0,0},{2,2,2,1})                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = | x          y    z         0 |                                         |
|     | -y*z-2*x^2 -y*x y^2-2*x*z x |                                         |
|     | -2*y*x+x*y x*z  -x^2      y |                                         |
|     | -2*y^2+x*z x^2  -x*y      z |                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : NCMatrix                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : isHomogeneous M                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : N = ncMatrix {gens B}                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = | x y z |                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : NCMatrix                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : isHomogeneous N                                                         |
