**************************************************************************

  * Function: *note basis: (Macaulay2Doc)basis,
  * Usage: 
        bas = basis(n,I)
  * Inputs:
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
      * I, an instance of the type *note NCIdeal: NCIdeal,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Degree: (Macaulay2Doc)basis, => ..., default value null, 
      * *note Limit: (Macaulay2Doc)basis, => ..., default value infinity, 
      * *note SourceRing: (Macaulay2Doc)basis, => ..., default value null, 
      * *note Strategy: (Macaulay2Doc)basis, => ..., default value null, 
      * *note Truncate: (Macaulay2Doc)basis, => ..., default value false, 
      * *note Variables: (Macaulay2Doc)basis, => ..., default value null, 
  * Outputs:
      * bas, an instance of the type *note NCMatrix: NCMatrix,, 

Description
===========

This command returns a basis (or minimal generating set, if the ground ring is
not a field), of a homogeneous two-sided ideal in a noncommutative ring.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : A = QQ{x,y,z}                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = A                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : NCPolynomialRing                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : p = y*z + z*y - x^2                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|            2                                                                |
|o2 = zy+yz-x                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : A                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : q = x*z + z*x - y^2                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|         2                                                                   |
|o3 = zx-y +xz                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : A                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : r = z^2 - x*y - y*x                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|      2                                                                      |
|o4 = z -yx-xy                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : A                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : I = ncIdeal{p,q,r}                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|                             2      2      2                                 |
|o5 = Two-sided ideal {zy+yz-x , zx-y +xz, z -yx-xy}                          |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : NCIdeal                                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : bas = basis(3,I)                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = | z*x^2-y^2*x+x*z*x z*y*x+y*z*x-x^3 z^2*x-y*x^2-x*y*x -y*x^2+x^2*y      |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : NCMatrix                                                                |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|-y^2*x+x*y^2 z*x*y-y^3+x*z*y z*y^2+y*z*y-y*x^2 z^2*y-y^2*x-y*x*y -z*x^2+x^2*z|
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|-z*y*x-y^3+y*x*z+x^3 -z*y^2+z*x*z+y*x^2+x*y*x -z*x*y+y^3+x*y*z-x^3           |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|-z*y^2+y^2*z z*y*z-z*x^2+y^2*x+y*x*y -y*x^2+x*z^2-x*y*x y*z^2-y^2*x-y*x*y    |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|z^3-z*y*x-z*x*y |                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

