|Complete!                                     |
|                                              |
|o1 = B                                        |
|                                              |
|o1 : NCQuotientRing                           |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i2 : g = -y^3-x*y*z+y*x*z+x^3                 |
|                                              |
|       3          3                           |
|o2 = -y +yxz-xyz+x                            |
|                                              |
|o2 : B                                        |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i3 : h = x^2 + y^2 + z^2                      |
|                                              |
|      2        2                              |
|o3 = y +yx+xy+x                               |
|                                              |
|o3 : B                                        |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i4 : isCentral h                              |
|                                              |
|o4 = true                                     |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i5 : isCentral g                              |
|                                              |
|o5 = true                                     |
+----------------------------------------------+

