isHomogeneous(NCIdeal) -- Determines whether the input defines a homogeneous object
***********************************************************************************

  * Function: *note isHomogeneous: (Macaulay2Doc)isHomogeneous,
  * Usage: 
        isHomogeneous x
  * Inputs:
      * x, an instance of the type *note NCIdeal: NCIdeal,, or an *note
        NCLeftIdeal: NCLeftIdeal, an *note NCRightIdeal: NCRightIdeal, an *note
        NCRing: NCRing, an *note NCMatrix: NCMatrix, or an *note NCRingElement:
        NCRingElement,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, 

Description
===========

Many methods in the NCAlgebra package require inputs to be homogeneous. The
meaning of "homogeneous" depens on the type of object.

If x is an *note NCRingElement: NCRingElement,, the method returns true if all
terms of x have the same degree.

If x is an *note NCIdeal: NCIdeal,, *note NCLeftIdeal: NCLeftIdeal,, or *note
NCRightIdeal: NCRightIdeal,, the method returns true if all generators of the
ideal are homogeneous (not necessarily of the same degree).

If x is an *note NCPolynomialRing: NCPolynomialRing,, the method returns true.
If x is any other *note NCRing: NCRing,, the method returns true if and only if
the defining ideal of x is homogeneous.

If x is an *note NCMatrix: NCMatrix,, the method returns true if integer
weights were assigned to the source and target of the associated map of free
right modules such that the map is graded (degree 0). See *note assignDegrees:
assignDegrees,.

+-----------------------------------+
|i1 : A=QQ{x,y,z}                   |
|                                   |
|o1 = A                             |
|                                   |
|o1 : NCPolynomialRing              |
+-----------------------------------+
|i2 : w=x^3-y^2                     |
|                                   |
|       2  3                        |
|o2 = -y +x                         |
|                                   |
|o2 : A                             |
+-----------------------------------+
|i3 : isHomogeneous w               |
|                                   |
|o3 = false                         |
+-----------------------------------+
|i4 : setWeights(A, {2,3,1})        |
|                                   |
|o4 = A                             |
|                                   |
|o4 : NCPolynomialRing              |
+-----------------------------------+
|i5 : isHomogeneous w               |
|                                   |
|o5 = true                          |
+-----------------------------------+
|i6 : I = ncIdeal{w,x+z^2}          |
|                                   |
|                        2  3   2   |
|o6 = Two-sided ideal {-y +x , z +x}|
|                                   |
|o6 : NCIdeal                       |
+-----------------------------------+
|i7 : isHomogeneous I               |
|                                   |
|o7 = true                          |
+-----------------------------------+
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : B = threeDimSklyanin(QQ,{1,1,-1},{x,y,z})                               |
|--Calling Bergman for NCGB calculation.                                      |
|Complete!                                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o8 = B                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : NCQuotientRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : M = ncMatrix {{x,y,z,0}, {-y*z-2*x^2,-y*x,z*x-x*z,x},{x*y-2*y*x,x*z,-x^2|
|                                                                             |
|o9 = | x          y    z         0 |                                         |
|     | -y*z-2*x^2 -y*x y^2-2*x*z x |                                         |
|     | -2*y*x+x*y x*z  -x^2      y |                                         |
|     | -2*y^2+x*z x^2  -x*y      z |                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o9 : NCMatrix                                                                |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|,y}, {-y^2-z*x,x^2,-x*y,z}}                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : isHomogeneous M                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o10 = false                                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : assignDegrees(M,{1,0,0,0},{2,2,2,1})                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o11 = | x          y    z         0 |                                        |
|      | -y*z-2*x^2 -y*x y^2-2*x*z x |                                        |
|      | -2*y*x+x*y x*z  -x^2      y |                                        |
|      | -2*y^2+x*z x^2  -x*y      z |                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o11 : NCMatrix                                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i12 : isHomogeneous M                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o12 = true                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i13 : N = ncMatrix {gens B}                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o13 = | x y z |                                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o13 : NCMatrix                                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i14 : isHomogeneous N                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o14 = true                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note isHomogeneous(NCRingMap): isHomogeneous_lpNCRingMap_rp, -- Determines
    if an NCRingMap preserves the natural grading
  * *note setWeights: setWeights, -- Set a nonstandard grading for a NCRing.
  * *note assignDegrees: assignDegrees, -- Weights entries of a matrix to make
    associated map of free modules graded

