===========

This command lifts an NCMatrix to a matrix over its *note ambient:
(Macaulay2Doc)ambient, NCRing.

+---------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : A = QQ{x,y,z,w}                                                 |
|                                                                     |
|o1 = A                                                               |
|                                                                     |
|o1 : NCPolynomialRing                                                |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : B = A/ncIdeal{y*z + z*y - x^2, x*z + z*x - y^2, z^2 - x*y - y*x}|
