|i3 : M = ncMatrix {{x,y,z,w},{y,z,w,x}}                              |
|                                                                     |
|o3 = | x y z w |                                                     |
|     | y z w x |                                                     |
|                                                                     |
|o3 : NCMatrix                                                        |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : N = M || 2*M || -3*M                                            |
|                                                                     |
|o4 = | x    y    z    w    |                                         |
|     | y    z    w    x    |                                         |
|     | 2*x  2*y  2*z  2*w  |                                         |
|     | 2*y  2*z  2*w  2*x  |                                         |
|     | -3*x -3*y -3*z -3*w |                                         |
|     | -3*y -3*z -3*w -3*x |                                         |
