|i5 : ring N                                                          |
|                                                                     |
|o5 = B                                                               |
|                                                                     |
|o5 : NCQuotientRing                                                  |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : ring lift N                                                     |
|                                                                     |
