matrix(NCRingMap) -- An NCMatrix associated to an NCRingMap.
************************************************************

  * Function: *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)matrix,
  * Usage: 
        matrix f
  * Inputs:
      * f, an instance of the type *note NCRingMap: NCRingMap,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Degree: (Macaulay2Doc)matrix_lpList_rp, => ..., default value
        null,
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note NCMatrix: NCMatrix,, 

Description
===========

This function returns a matrix whose entries are the images of the source
generators in the target ring of f. The type of matrix depends on the type of
the target ring.

+---------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : A = skewPolynomialRing(QQ,(-1)_QQ,{w,x,y,z})  |
|--Calling Bergman for NCGB calculation.            |
|Complete!                                          |
|                                                   |
|o1 = A                                             |
|                                                   |
|o1 : NCQuotientRing                                |
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : B = QQ[a,b,c,SkewCommutative=>true]           |
|                                                   |
|o2 = B                                             |
|                                                   |
|o2 : PolynomialRing, 3 skew commutative variable(s)|
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : f = ncMap(B,A,{a^3,b^2,a+b,a-b})              |
|                                                   |
|o3 = NCRingMap B <--- A                            |
|                                                   |
|o3 : NCRingMap                                     |
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : matrix f                                      |
|                                                   |
|o4 = | 0 0 a+b a-b |                               |
|                                                   |
|             1      4                              |
|o4 : Matrix B  <-- B                               |
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : g = ncMap(A,A,{x,y,z,w})                      |
|                                                   |
|o5 = NCRingMap A <--- A                            |
|                                                   |
|o5 : NCRingMap                                     |
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : matrix g                                      |
|                                                   |
|o6 = | x y z w |                                   |
|                                                   |
|o6 : NCMatrix                                      |
+---------------------------------------------------+

