minimizeRelations -- Minimizes a list of NCRingElements
*******************************************************

  * Usage: 
        mgens = minimizeRelations(gens)
  * Inputs:
      * gens, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * Verbosity => ..., default value 0
  * Outputs:
      * mgens, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 

Description
===========

Given a list of NCRingElements, this method produces a generating set for the
NCIdeal generated by the list which (possibly) uses fewer generators and/or
fewer NCRing generators. Commonly used with Link to endomorphismRing.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : Q = QQ[a,b,c,d]                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = Q                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : R = Q/ideal{a*b+c*d}                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : QuotientRing                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : kRes = res(coker vars R, LengthLimit=>7)                                |
|                                                                             |
|      1      4      7      8      8      8      8      8                     |
|o3 = R  <-- R  <-- R  <-- R  <-- R  <-- R  <-- R  <-- R                      |
|                                                                             |
|     0      1      2      3      4      5      6      7                      |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : ChainComplex                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : M = coker kRes.dd_5                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = cokernel {4} | b  0  0  0  0  c  0 0 |                                  |
