Description
===========

This defines a left ideal in a noncommutative ring.  Not much can be done with
these objects at this point (as one can tell by the dearth of operations that
take an NCLeftIdeal as input), but eventually it will be a 'fully featured'
object.

+----------------------------------------------+
|i1 : A = QQ{x,y,z}                            |
|                                              |
|o1 = A                                        |
|                                              |
|o1 : NCPolynomialRing                         |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i2 : p = y*z + z*y - x^2                      |
|                                              |
|            2                                 |
|o2 = zy+yz-x                                  |
|                                              |
