|                                                                             |
|o11 : NCMatrix                                                               |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|y^2*z+y*x*z+2*y*x*y+x*y*z+3*x*y^2-x*y*x-x^2*z+x^2*y+x^3                      |
|2*y^2*z+y^3+y*x*y+x*y*x+2*x^2*z+x^3                                          |
|-y^2*z+y^3+y*x*z-y*x*y+x*y*z+x*y^2+2*x*y*x+x^2*z+3*x^2*y                     |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|2*y^2*z+y^3+y*x*y+x*y*x+2*x^2*z+x^3                      |                   |
|-y^2*z+y^3+y*x*z-y*x*y+x*y*z+x*y^2+2*x*y*x+x^2*z+3*x^2*y |                   |
