|                                                  |
|o5 = | 2 0 0 |                                    |
|     | 1 2 0 |                                    |
|     | 1 2 3 |                                    |
|                                                  |
|              3       3                           |
|o5 : Matrix QQ  <-- QQ                            |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : N*L                                          |
|                                                  |
|o6 = | z+y+2*x 2*z+2*y 3*z |                      |
|     | z+2*y+x 2*z+2*x 3*x |                      |
|     | 2*z+y+x 2*y+2*x 3*y |                      |
|                                                  |
|o6 : NCMatrix                                     |
+--------------------------------------------------+

