Description
===========

This subtracts NCMatrices.

+----------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : A = QQ{x,y,z}                                  |
|                                                    |
|o1 = A                                              |
|                                                    |
|o1 : NCPolynomialRing                               |
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : M = ncMatrix {{x, y, z}}                       |
|                                                    |
|o2 = | x y z |                                      |
|                                                    |
|o2 : NCMatrix                                       |
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : sigma = ncMap(A,A,{y,z,x})                     |
|                                                    |
|o3 = NCRingMap A <--- A                             |
|                                                    |
|o3 : NCRingMap                                      |
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : N = ncMatrix {{M},{sigma M}, {sigma sigma M}}  |
|                                                    |
|o4 = | x y z |                                      |
|     | y z x |                                      |
|     | z x y |                                      |
|                                                    |
|o4 : NCMatrix                                       |
