NCRingElement * List -- Scales a list by an NCRingElement on the left
*********************************************************************

  * Operator: *note *: (Macaulay2Doc)_st,
  * Usage: 
        fxs = f*xs
  * Inputs:
      * f, an instance of the type *note NCRingElement: NCRingElement,, 
      * xs, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 
  * Outputs:
      * xsf, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 

Description
===========

Scales a list by an NCRingElement on the right.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : A = QQ{x,y}                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = A                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : NCPolynomialRing                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : f = x^2+y^2                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|      2  2                                                                   |
|o2 = y +x                                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : A                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : bas = flatten entries basis(3,A)                                        |
|                                                                             |
|       3    2        2    2          2   3                                   |
|o3 = {x , yx , xyx, y x, x y, yxy, xy , y }                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : f*bas                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|       2 3  5   3 2  2  2   2     3     4   2 2    2 2   4    3    2         |
|o4 = {y x +x , y x +x yx , y xyx+x yx, y x+x y x, y x y+x y, y xy+x yxy,     |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|      2  2  3 2   5  2 3                                                     |
|     y xy +x y , y +x y }                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

Ways to use this method:
========================

