      * an instance of the type *note NCRingMap: NCRingMap,, 

Description
===========

+-----------------------------+
|i1 : A = QQ{x,y}             |
|                             |
|o1 = A                       |
|                             |
|o1 : NCPolynomialRing        |
+-----------------------------+
|i2 : f = ncMap(A,A,{x^2,y^2})|
|                             |
|o2 = NCRingMap A <--- A      |
|                             |
|o2 : NCRingMap               |
+-----------------------------+
|i3 : g = ncMap(A,A,{x+y,y})  |
|                             |
|o3 = NCRingMap A <--- A      |
|                             |
|o3 : NCRingMap               |
+-----------------------------+
|i4 : gens A/f @@ g           |
|                             |
|       2  2   2              |
|o4 = {y +x , y }             |
|                             |
|o4 : List                    |
+-----------------------------+
|i5 : gens A/g @@ f           |
|                             |
|       2        2   2        |
|o5 = {y +yx+xy+x , y }       |
|                             |
|o5 : List                    |
