normalElements(NCRingMap,ZZ) -- Finds elements normalized by a ring map
***********************************************************************

  * Function: *note normalElements: normalElements,
  * Usage: 
        normalElements(f,n)
  * Inputs:
      * f, an instance of the type *note NCRingMap: NCRingMap,, 
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, a homogeneous degree in which
        to search for normal elements
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 

Description
===========

A normal element x in an NCRing R determines an automorphism f of R by
a*x=x*f(a). Conversely, given a ring endomorphism, we may ask if any x satisfy
the above equation for all a.

Given an NCRingMap f and a degree n, this method returns solutions to the
equations a*x=x*f(a) for all generators a of R.

+-------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : B = skewPolynomialRing(QQ,(-1)_QQ,{x,y,z,w})|
|--Calling Bergman for NCGB calculation.          |
|Complete!                                        |
|                                                 |
|o1 = B                                           |
|                                                 |
|o1 : NCQuotientRing                              |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : sigma = ncMap(B,B,{y,z,w,x})                |
|                                                 |
|o2 = NCRingMap B <--- B                          |
|                                                 |
|o2 : NCRingMap                                   |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : C = oreExtension(B,sigma,a)                 |
|--Calling Bergman for NCGB calculation.          |
|Complete!                                        |
|                                                 |
|o3 = C                                           |
|                                                 |
|o3 : NCQuotientRing                              |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : sigmaC = ncMap(C,C,{y,z,w,x,a})             |
|                                                 |
|o4 = NCRingMap C <--- C                          |
|                                                 |
|o4 : NCRingMap                                   |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : normalElements(sigmaC,1)                    |
|                                                 |
|o5 = | a |                                       |
|                                                 |
|o5 : NCMatrix                                    |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : normalElements(sigmaC,2)                    |
|                                                 |
|o6 = 0                                           |
|                                                 |
|              1                                  |
|o6 : Matrix QQ  <-- 0                            |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : normalElements(sigmaC @@ sigmaC,2)          |
|                                                 |
|o7 = | a^2 |                                     |
|                                                 |
|o7 : NCMatrix                                    |
+-------------------------------------------------+

