transpose(NCMatrix) -- Transposes an NCMatrix
*********************************************

  * Function: *note transpose: (Macaulay2Doc)transpose,
  * Usage: 
        L = transpose M
  * Inputs:
      * M, an instance of the type *note NCMatrix: NCMatrix,, 
  * Outputs:
      * L, an instance of the type *note NCMatrix: NCMatrix,, 

Description
===========

This command transposes an NCMatrix

+---------------------------------------+
|i1 : A = QQ{a,b,c,d}                   |
|                                       |
|o1 = A                                 |
|                                       |
|o1 : NCPolynomialRing                  |
+---------------------------------------+
|i2 : M = ncMatrix {{a,b,c,d},{b,c,d,a}}|
|                                       |
|o2 = | a b c d |                       |
|     | b c d a |                       |
|                                       |
|o2 : NCMatrix                          |
+---------------------------------------+
|i3 : N = M || 2*M || -3*M              |
|                                       |
|o3 = | a    b    c    d    |           |
|     | b    c    d    a    |           |
|     | 2*a  2*b  2*c  2*d  |           |
|     | 2*b  2*c  2*d  2*a  |           |
|     | -3*a -3*b -3*c -3*d |           |
|     | -3*b -3*c -3*d -3*a |           |
|                                       |
|o3 : NCMatrix                          |
+---------------------------------------+
|i4 : transpose N                       |
|                                       |
|o4 = | a b 2*a 2*b -3*a -3*b |         |
|     | b c 2*b 2*c -3*b -3*c |         |
|     | c d 2*c 2*d -3*c -3*d |         |
|     | d a 2*d 2*a -3*d -3*a |         |
|                                       |
|o4 : NCMatrix                          |
+---------------------------------------+

