ZZ * NCMatrix -- Product of NCMatrices
**************************************

  * Operator: *note *: (Macaulay2Doc)_st,
  * Usage: 
        L = a*M
  * Inputs:
      * a, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
      * M, an instance of the type *note NCMatrix: NCMatrix,, 
  * Outputs:
      * L, an instance of the type *note NCMatrix: NCMatrix,, 

Description
===========

This command allows for the scaling of an *note NCMatrix: NCMatrix, by an
element in *note ZZ: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,.

+--------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : B = threeDimSklyanin(QQ,{1,1,-1},{x,y,z})    |
|--Calling Bergman for NCGB calculation.           |
|Complete!                                         |
|                                                  |
|o1 = B                                            |
|                                                  |
|o1 : NCQuotientRing                               |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : M = ncMatrix {{x, y, z}}                     |
|                                                  |
|o2 = | x y z |                                    |
|                                                  |
|o2 : NCMatrix                                     |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : sigma = ncMap(B,B,{y,z,x})                   |
|                                                  |
|o3 = NCRingMap B <--- B                           |
|                                                  |
|o3 : NCRingMap                                    |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : N = ncMatrix {{M},{sigma M}, {sigma sigma M}}|
|                                                  |
|o4 = | x y z |                                    |
|     | y z x |                                    |
|     | z x y |                                    |
|                                                  |
|o4 : NCMatrix                                     |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : 3*N                                          |
|                                                  |
|o5 = | 3*x 3*y 3*z |                              |
|     | 3*y 3*z 3*x |                              |
|     | 3*z 3*x 3*y |                              |
|                                                  |
|o5 : NCMatrix                                     |
+--------------------------------------------------+

